MultiLingualTexts:
  - id: MLC_4BV
    en-US: TRUE if first scan, then set to FALSE
  - id: MLC_4RG
    en-US: Actual desired command based on active mode
  - id: MLC_3Kx
    en-US: Desired command if not interlocked
  - id: MLC_35c
    en-US: Movement timer
  - id: MLC_Rv
    en-US: Normal state of previous scan
  - id: MLC_3Xe
    en-US: Movement counter of valve disk
  - id: MLC_3DQ
    en-US: ALARM - Sensor conflict
  - id: MLC_gt
    en-US: ALARM - Valve failed to close
  - id: MLC_4eR
    en-US: ALARM - Valve failed to open
  - id: MLC_4QX
    en-US: ALARM - Movement timeout
  - id: MLC_4yQ
    en-US: WARNING - Number of valve cycles reached
  - id: MLC_3JW
    en-US: Error valve state
  - id: MLC_XS
    en-US: Normal valve state
  - id: MLC_4HP
    en-US: Closed valve state
  - id: MLC_4x8
    en-US: Opening valve state
  - id: MLC_3xp
    en-US: Open valve state
  - id: MLC_5CV
    en-US: Closing valve state
